     or <a href="http://media.basilgohar.com/derf-talks/20120124150343.MTS.webm">webm HD</a>
     (starts at slide 51)
</li>
<li>Part 3: Probability Modeling
     <a href="http://people.xiph.org/~giles/2012/daala-intro-201201-part3a.ogv"</a>part 3a</a>
     <a href="http://people.xiph.org/~giles/2012/daala-intro-201201-part3b.ogv"</a>part 3b</a>
     or <a href="http://media.basilgohar.com/derf-talks/20120125151202.MTS.webm">webm HD part 3a</a>
     <a href="http://media.basilgohar.com/derf-talks/20120125162037.MTS.webm">HD part 3b</a>
     (starts at slide 92)
</li>
<li>Part 4: Motion Compensation
     <a href="http://people.xiph.org/~giles/2012/daala-intro-201201-part4a.ogv"</a>part 4a</a>
     <a href="http://people.xiph.org/~giles/2012/daala-intro-201201-part4b.ogv"</a>part 4b</a>
     or <a href="http://media.basilgohar.com/derf-talks/20120126150713.MTS.webm">webm HD part 4a</a>
     <a href="http://media.basilgohar.com/derf-talks/20120126162137.MTS.webm">HD part 4b</a>
     (starts at slide 139)
